
# 2026-07-21

 Compile:
 make a.out b.out

 Two Programs.
 a.out: The 2D-Poisson Solver
        The Inputdata are:
           ./Gitterfuellung: The Description of the Materialfilling.
                             This is written by the GdfidL-Solver.
                             An Inputfile which writes such File is:
                                BlaBla.gdf
                                gd1 < BlaBla.gdf
           ./EpsData: Specifies the EprR of the used Materials.
           ./ChargeData: Specifies the Charges.
	SpecifyPhiAtxy.f90: Specifies the Phi at the Boundary between
                            Metal and Dielectrics.
 Run the Solver.
     ./a.out
 The Result is in two Files.
     ./Potential.mtv: This is a MTV-File which describes a Plot of the
                      computed Potential.
                      Look at that Data via
                          mymtv2 Potential.mtv
     ./PhiData: The computed Potential in a human readable Format.

 The main-Sourcecode is 'ReadInputDataAndSolve.f90'.
 -----------
 b.out: A Program which reads the Potential in 'PhiData'.
     This Program also writes the Potential as a MTV-File.
     This Program is given as an Example for a Program which reads
     the Data in 'PhiData'.
 The main-Sourcecode is 'ReadPhiData.f90'.

